  "annotationNotes": "Street-axis intersections, canal bridge centres and preserved monuments inspected on original scans against IGN PLANIGNV2. Excludes new street cuts and the projected Amidonniers bridge. Chateau d eau annotations corrected to the actual circular tower. Check points never participate in fitting. Capitole check refined to the centre of the open square, excluding facade and corner; four adjacent street-axis anchors added. Quarter survey: Dalbade, Taur, Royal garden, Grand Rond, Saint-Cyprien. Fifteen withheld landmarks. Paul-Sabatier and De-la-Bastide checks refined to actual road centrelines; comparisons use these identical revised annotations in both versions. Modern road coordinates cross-checked with OpenStreetMap nodes (2026-10-01); historical topology checked before matching. Tour-du-Sac through-junction excluded; retained junction on Rue de la Laque is withheld.",
